docs {
  One-way scheduled connections between network points, chained later by the route planner.
  Uses the Bangkok hub, Chiang Mai hub and Chiang Mai branch created in 15 Service Areas,
  plus a Nakhon Sawan transit hub created here:

  Bangkok hub -> Nakhon Sawan hub -> Chiang Mai hub -> Chiang Mai branch
}
